://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/[g]/README.md#user-content-Generic-XTS-License:~:text=Generic%20XTS%20License)\r\nshort name: generic-xts-license\r\nmarkers: No Warranty Marker\r\ncategory: Generic XTS License\r\nOSI status: _none_\r\n\r\n**ScanCode**\r\nmatched id: other-permissive OR gpl-1.0-plus\r\n\r\n**Comment**\r\nWe will add this to the universe as yet another permission terms instance. No vote to add it to SPDX.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2353775311/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2427818617","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2558#issuecomment-2427818617","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2558","id":2427818617,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86QtZJ5","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-21T21:58:42Z","updated_at":"2024-10-21T21:58:42Z","body":"this is another one of those permissive grant or GPL all-in-one, but then adds a bit on the project's preferred license for contributions.\r\n\r\nGiven its use, does this lean towards inclusion?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2427818617/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2455741144","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2558#issuecomment-2455741144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2558","id":2455741144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86SX6LY","user":{"login":"Pizza-Ria","id":46799628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Nzk5NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46799628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria","html_url":"https://github.com/Pizza-Ria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T21:30:15Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T21:31:04Z","body":"No right to distribute - that runs counter to the OSD - vote \"no\" to include in SPDX.  I also don't get the whole GPL line - is that a dual license grant within a license????","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2455741144/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2476997940","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2558#issuecomment-2476997940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2558","id":2476997940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86To_00","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-14T17:19:37Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T17:25:44Z","body":"@xsuchy is there a Fedora issue?\r\n\r\nThis looks like one of the old licenses when the grants were a bit \"loose\". I think there have been discussions in the past on \"use\" which is not a specific copyright act grant, but could be interpreted to include \"distribute\". I feel like @richardfontana has some opinion on this topic... \r\n\r\n[edited] Nevermind! found it https://gitlab.com/fedora/legal/fedora-license-data/-/issues/561. \r\n\r\nand pasting pertinent Richard's quote from that issue:\r\n\"This license does not include explicit permission to distribute, but refers to \"use\" which was undoubtedly intended to cover this (cf. the paragraph on the GPL which refers to it as \"freer than GPL\"). We had a theoretical working approach for a long time to view \"sufficiently old\" permissive licenses with permission to \"use\" but no permission to distribute (and sometimes no permission to modify or copy) as tolerably informal free software licenses, since it is clear both historically and on textual analysis that such permissions were intended to be encompassed by \"use\" as a general matter.\"","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2476997940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2477013322","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2558#issuecomment-2477013322","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2558","id":2477013322,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86TpDlK","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-14T17:27:09Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T17:27:09Z","body":"note: This license is just contained inside two files (generic_xts.c/h) of the bundled tcplay library for ZuluCrypt. The main tcplay is under a BSD-2-clause, but these files have a different header that doesn't match that and instead mentioned using it under the GPL (and something freer than the GPL).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2477013322/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2477015314","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2558#issuecomment-2477015314","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2558","id":2477015314,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86TpEES","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.githu